      "name": "offset_black_to_white_clamps_at_u8",
      "comment": "Black → white over [0, 1 s], Offset on both sides. 2.5 s = period 2, u = 0.5 s: the mid gray plus 2·(white − black) in premultiplied OkLab has L ≈ 2.5 → every channel clamps to 255. −0.5 s = period −1, u = 0.5 s: L ≈ 0.5 − 1 → clamps to 0. Alpha is 1 throughout (1 + n·0).",
